{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00463",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 7.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.9,
      "text": "Hi doctor, sorry, the lift was out and I had to take the stairs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.53,
      "end_seconds": 11.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "So, you're fine, sit down. So, what brings you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.76,
      "end_seconds": 17.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Yeah, it's constant thirst. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.83,
      "end_seconds": 20.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.22,
      "end_seconds": 23.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "It's been going on for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.94,
      "end_seconds": 30.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.09,
      "end_seconds": 35.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.08,
      "end_seconds": 36.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.88,
      "end_seconds": 47.87,
      "duration_seconds": 9.99,
      "text": "I've also been passing urine a lot, for about a month. I had blurry vision before. That's settled now, um, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.39,
      "end_seconds": 51.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.64,
      "end_seconds": 57.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.29,
      "end_seconds": 62.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Have you had any foot sores, fever or abdominal pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.69,
      "end_seconds": 66.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "No, no foot sores, fever or abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.37,
      "end_seconds": 70.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.91,
      "end_seconds": 73.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "No, no weight loss or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.92,
      "end_seconds": 78.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Alright, what about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.59,
      "end_seconds": 80.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.77,
      "end_seconds": 85.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Let me make a quick note of that before I forget."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.15,
      "end_seconds": 86.85,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.68,
      "end_seconds": 106.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.94,
      "end_seconds": 109.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.03,
      "end_seconds": 115.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.87,
      "end_seconds": 127.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.34,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.63,
      "end_seconds": 132.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Alright, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.52,
      "end_seconds": 137.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for about a year. I have heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.7,
      "end_seconds": 145.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.5,
      "end_seconds": 148.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Um, it's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.29,
      "end_seconds": 151.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.43,
      "end_seconds": 161.11,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "I had a bypass operation six years ago. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.81,
      "end_seconds": 168.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.58,
      "end_seconds": 171.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "So, no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.23,
      "end_seconds": 174.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Alright, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.3,
      "end_seconds": 178.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.99,
      "end_seconds": 182.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.21,
      "end_seconds": 188.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast. Clopidogrel, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.93,
      "end_seconds": 191.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.05,
      "end_seconds": 196.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "75 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.02,
      "end_seconds": 200.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.9,
      "end_seconds": 204.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Breathe in deeply... and out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.39,
      "end_seconds": 219.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Your feet look fine, no ulcers or sores, and the pulses are palpable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.84,
      "end_seconds": 223.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.64,
      "end_seconds": 243.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Sensation to the monofilament is reduced on the right foot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.05,
      "end_seconds": 244.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.66,
      "end_seconds": 255.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.51,
      "end_seconds": 257.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.12,
      "end_seconds": 274.34,
      "duration_seconds": 15.22,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, this looks most like diabetes that isn't well controlled. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. A urine infection is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.16,
      "end_seconds": 277.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.9,
      "end_seconds": 294.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.61,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like diabetes that isn't well controlled, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had constant thirst for three weeks, mild, and no abdominal pain or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.61,
      "end_seconds": 299.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.34,
      "end_seconds": 310.64,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine protein test, for diabetes. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.2,
      "end_seconds": 312.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.65,
      "end_seconds": 334.94,
      "duration_seconds": 21.29,
      "text": "Cut back on sweets, sugary drinks and white rice, and keep to regular meal times. Check your feet every day, and never walk barefoot. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Keep an eye out, and if you vomit repeatedly or become drowsy, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.57,
      "end_seconds": 337.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.01,
      "end_seconds": 339.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.46,
      "end_seconds": 342.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.9,
      "end_seconds": 348.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.68,
      "end_seconds": 354.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.0,
      "end_seconds": 359.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.98,
      "end_seconds": 362.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Thank you. I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}